# Tamin UI tokens

No hardcoded `Color(…)`, `.dp`/`.sp`, or UI copy in Compose.

- Colors: `LocalTaminColors.current` (`SemanticColors.kt`)
- Sizes: `Spacing`, `CornerRadius`, `IconSize`, `Elevation`, `Thickness`, `ButtonDimens`, `HeaderDecoration` (`Shape.kt`)
- Copy: `stringResource(Res.string.*)` in `core-ui/.../values/strings.xml`
- Missing token → add it to the theme, do not inline a literal
- Search `core-ui/ui/components/` before creating a widget

```kotlin
// ❌ Modifier.size(18.dp); RoundedCornerShape(20.dp); Text("ارسال گواهی")
// ✅ Modifier.size(ButtonDimens.loadingIndicatorSize)
// ✅ RoundedCornerShape(CornerRadius.cardCompact)
// ✅ Text(stringResource(Res.string.active_relation_send_certificate))
```
